# Phase 1 (P0) is READ-ONLY public market data — NO API keys are required or used.
#
# This file is a placeholder for later phases (simulator / live). When keys are
# eventually added, copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and fill in.
# Keys must NEVER be committed or logged. Use IP-whitelisted, read-only-where-possible keys.
#
# Format (one block per exchange), unused in P0:
# BINANCE_API_KEY=
# BINANCE_API_SECRET=
# BYBIT_API_KEY=
# BYBIT_API_SECRET=
# OKX_API_KEY=
# OKX_API_SECRET=
# OKX_API_PASSWORD=
# MEXC_API_KEY=
# MEXC_API_SECRET=
# GATE_API_KEY=
# GATE_API_SECRET=
